From 4ab7ced8ab94bfaeb24858ab40e2845a58cbb9e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:42:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(history): persist listening history and add listening
 stats page

Record qualified listens (30s or half of a short track) in a new
library_play_events table (Room v17 -> v18). The home heatmap now reads
from the table instead of an in-memory map that reset on restart. Add a
stats page with range tabs, totals, time-of-day chart and top tracks,
albums and artists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FEDCezPFi51Bf5mkmoEhB4
